<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell three points to 1,369.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell three points to 1,369.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,369 today from 1,372 on July 14, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1451    13.175	  1449    13.156</p>
<p>   1a   1362 10313.000	  1363 10325.000</p>
<p>   2    1722    24.594	  1730    24.719</p>
<p>   2a   1646 13500.000	  1651 13538.000</p>
